msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "knowledgeProficiencyAgent is functional"
msgstr "knowledgeProficiencyAgent 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent is functional: a gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency expresses the knowledge depth of exactly one agent, whose identity is constitutive of the reified proficiency."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency 恰好表达一个主体的知识深度,该主体的身份构成了这一具体化熟练度的构成要素。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "knowledgeProficiencyLevel is functional"
msgstr "knowledgeProficiencyLevel 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyLevel is functional: a gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency records exactly one attained ordinal depth on the knowledgeAware to knowledgeMastered ladder."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyLevel 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency 恰好记录在从 knowledgeAware 到 knowledgeMastered 的阶梯上所达到的一个序数深度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "knowledgeProficiencyScale is functional"
msgstr "knowledgeProficiencyScale 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyScale is functional: a gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency's level is read against exactly one scale, the native gmeow:KnowledgeLevel or a Bloom's / SOLO / Dreyfus alternate."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyScale 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency 的水平恰好依据一种量表来解读,即原生的 gmeow:KnowledgeLevel,或布鲁姆分类法/SOLO/德雷福斯模型中的一种替代量表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencySubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "knowledgeProficiencySubject is functional"
msgstr "knowledgeProficiencySubject 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencySubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowledgeProficiencySubject is functional: a gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency concerns exactly one subject entity — a topic, person, place, or event — constitutive of which proficiency it is."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowledgeProficiencySubject 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency 恰好涉及一个主体实体——一个主题、人物、地点或事件——它构成了该项能力究竟是关于什么的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyAgentFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyAgentFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyAgentFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/knowledgeProficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgentFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent ."
msgstr "gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgentFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent ."

